      "trend": "The trend in the research is to develop high-entropy alloys (HEAs) that can overcome the strength-ductility trade-off. Various processing techniques such as mechanical alloying, spark plasma sintering, and directional solidification have been explored to achieve this goal. The research has also focused on understanding the effects of chemical short-range order, precipitation structures, and deformation mechanisms on the mechanical properties of HEAs.",
